    "title": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -300,
      "maxW": 4240,
      "text": "Tasks · When and Deadline at a glance (§24 final; §25 proposed)"
    },
    "howto": {
      "x": -560,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 480,
      "size": 24,
      "text": "How to try it\n\n• Press Play, then click inside once so it has the keys.\n• The When is quiet grey text after the title and its notes hint; only a deadline is a capsule, at the row's end.\n• The checkbox ring: red overdue, amber due today, blue planned for today (outside Today). With both, the deadline's ring outside and a thin blue one inside.\n• Hover a date for its full date; click it for the popover."
    },
    "t_ref": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 900,
      "maxW": 2880,
      "text": "Reference"
    },
    "n_ref": {
      "x": -560,
      "y": 1200,
      "w": 480,
      "size": 24,
      "text": "Both boards are generated from the prototype's own functions and CSS, so they read exactly as it does. §24 of INTERACTIONS-v2.md is the build spec."
    },
